ump) && !misalign_fault; redirect = actual_taken != in.pred_taken; redirect_target = actual_taken ? (is_jump ? jump_target : branch_target) : in.pc + 4. Export training strobe (in.valid && is_branch), resolved direction and in.pc[9:2]. pc_next, trap and EX/MEM payload logic unchanged.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Instantiate branch_predictor; wire the fetch-side lookup from if_stage and the EX-side training port gated with !stall_ex_mem so a branch held by a dmem stall updates its counter exactly once.\"\n  - file: test/test_branch_predictor.py\n    description: \"cocotb unit test for branch_predictor: counter increments/decrements and saturates at 0 and 3, prediction bit follows ctr[1], distinct pc indices are independent, no update when the enable is low.\"", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01WLVnScmKRBvtdzgxBH9xWD", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
